The gaming community is offered games of various genres, and simulators occupy a significant niche among them – these can be football managers, airplane pilots, running your own business, or even completely crazy ones – for example, a goat simulator. Empire TV Tycoon – it’s also a simulator, but in this case – television.

Game features:
- The player gains control over an entire television channel.
- To complete the game you need to make the channel popular.
- You have a lot to do:
- drawing up a program taking into account days of the week, time, etc.;
- concluding contracts for advertising displays;
- hiring channel employees – operators, announcers, presenters, etc.;
- creating your own shows and so on.

